{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12427","headline":"题嵩阳焦道士石壁 · 钱起","name":"题嵩阳焦道士石壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三峯花畔碧堂悬，锦里真人此得仙。\n玉体才飞西蜀雨，霓裳欲向大罗天。\n彩云不散烧丹竈，白鹿时藏种玉田。\n幸入桃源因去世，方期丹诀一延年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12427.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12427","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}